        "# List\n",
        "\n",
        "A list is a mutable ordered sequence, commonly written with square brackets, such as `[1, 2, 3]`. Its elements can be replaced, added, or removed.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-list)"
